    "created_at": "2016-05-20T19:01:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T19:01:25Z",
    "body": "Implementations are allowed to implement the UI for inputs in any way they like. Chrome has chosen a format that matches your local operating system settings, but for example on iOS Safari uses a completely different UI.\n\nThe standard does not have opinions about the UI user agents choose. A completely conformant implementation of the standard would be one that displays \"On the first day of April, the year two-thousand-sixteen.\"\n",
